\241\15\175\80\222\4\173\79\151\2\175\80\211\75","\183\106\202\60"),v7("\105\50\224\69\202\2\66\83\49\178\89\208\86\1\82\39\247\88\217\3\14\27\98\219\10\203\4\27\26\54\253\10\210\23\22\89\42\178\67\203\86\3\84\38\178\88\202\24\66\85\55\230\10\208\16\66\89\42\247\79\205\87","\98\58\66\146\42\191\118"),"Cycads are older than some dinosaurs! That's not for everyone! It's for Sprout!"},[v7("\176\223\83\246\115\248\255\161","\186\228\144\28\184\44\174")]={"Vee already knows all my facts! They're programmed in! Ah... right! Silly me!",v7("\48\27\31\86\7\13\17\19\2\94\23\19\70\10\21\86\12\11\9\2\70\19\21\0\3\94\9\3\22\14\22\31\3\13\91\86\41\22\84\88\72\94\15\30\11\82\90\4\15\25\18\2\72\80\84\86\9\24\90\21\9\11\8\5\3\80","\118\102\126\122"),v7("\234\14\141\167\161\207\75\137\167\188\217\7\141\241\161\207\2\135\233\233\156\34\200\239\169\202\14\200\230\184\204\25\135\255\161\209\10\156\226\164\197\75\134\238\166\217\75\128\242\166\216\25\141\227\232\205\30\141\244\188\213\4\134\244\233","\200\188\107\232\135"),"I offered Vee a dinosaur fact and got— nothing! Polite nothing!","Vee and I are past and future! That's on a poster! I've seen the poster!","I don't think Vee sees me standing here! That's okay! I'll stand somewhere else!","Past and future! We're a matching set! One of us got the poster!","Vee's channel would be great! Even if it's just static, I'd watch it!"},[v7("\24\211\142\101\4\216\3\201\147\111\2","\159\76\156\193\43\91")]={v7("\94\35\27\103\161\80\3\249\120\37\10\53\163\70\80\249\112\32\29\53\164\91\70\170\117\37\5\112\229\90\72\239\117\41\26\122\171\90\3\235\119\40\78\92\229\65\66\238\57\56\1\53\166\70\81\248\124\47\26\53\173\64\78\171\57\28\1\121\172\93\70\230\96\109","\138\25\76\110\21\197\41\35"),"Well— not all fossils are skeletal remains actually! Just most! Don't be discouraged!","It's not a bad thing! Variation in data is key to new discoveries!",v7("\105\243\39\71\52\77\254\77\253\62\89\35\20\179\75\188\31\92\35\71\254\104\243\33\70\57\88\183\79\242\11