er there! I'm pointing! Can you see the pointing?!",v7("\192\171\207\192\174\224\236\208\232\224\221\218\238\178\215\153\224\174\203\152\175\142\203\206\175\176\194\216\225\225\142\234\238\173\203\153\255\172\207\215\174\224\253\205\238\185\142\215\234\161\220\153\226\165\143\153\192\178\142\216\248\161\215\152\175\129\217\216\246\224\199\202\175\166\199\215\234\225","\185\143\192\174"),"I'm not panicking! I'm doing the calm version of panicking!","It's close! It's very close! I've stopped enjoying this!","Don't look at it! Or do! I don't know how twisted eyes work! Just move!","Hide! Somewhere! Anywhere! I'll hide too! We'll hide separately!","That one has teeth! Most of them do! I checked! It wasn't helpful!",v7("\144\92\120\210\224\241\184\87\44\222\235\228\253\76\43\151\254\238\174\86\49\219\235\160\253\107\55\195\184\245\181\76\43\150\184\213\181\76\43\151\241\242\253\74\45\195\235\232\185\64\120\218\225\161\184\93\40\210\234\245\180\86\61\150","\129\221\37\88\183\152"),"Run in a— a zigzag! No, straight! Straight is faster! Sorry!","I'm being brave! This is what brave looks like on me! It's shaky!"},[v7("\122\203\245\36\17\8\112\213","\92\63\135\176\114\80")]={v7("\2\248\80\68\58\71\51\230\84\16\48\89\119\176\102\5\57\78\34\233\21\16\42\73\51\177\21\45\127\71\57\230\80\68\43\67\51\176\70\5\57\78\34\233\21\16\42\73\51\177","\43\86\144\53\100\95"),"Up we go! Or down! Either direction is fine as long as it's away!","I always wanted to be the one who presses the button! I wasn't! Again!",v7("\153\249\195\38\41\227\83\174\180\134\21\48\244\89\176\249\195\62\60\182\28\145\236\134\35\45\244\83\178\241\134\54\41\225\83\169\231\207\36\45\183\81\189\246\206\57\38\242\29\252\211\207\34\59\227\28\181\230\134\54\33\249\85\175\253\195\52\104\250\93\191\253\207\62\45\228\29","\60\220\149\166\80\72\151"),"In here we're briefly safe! Briefly is still something!","I'll just— stand very still in the corner! Like a fossil! Fitting!",v7("\168\39\176\224\159\105\255\214\131\39\173\2